Grammar

    0 $accept: Program $end

    1 Program: Decls

    2 Decls: Decls Decl
    3      | ε

    4 Decl: FuncDecl
    5     | VarDecl
    6     | TypeDecl
    7     | TypedefDecl

    8 TypedefDecl: TYPEDEF VarType IDENTIFIER SEMICOLON
    9            | TYPEDEF STRUCT IDENTIFIER LBRACE FieldDecls RBRACE IDENTIFIER SEMICOLON
   10            | TYPEDEF UNION IDENTIFIER LBRACE FieldDecls RBRACE IDENTIFIER SEMICOLON

   11 FuncDecl: STATIC VarType IDENTIFIER LPARENTHESES ParamList RPARENTHESES SEMICOLON
   12         | STATIC VarType IDENTIFIER LPARENTHESES ParamList RPARENTHESES FuncBody
   13         | VarType IDENTIFIER LPARENTHESES ParamList RPARENTHESES SEMICOLON
   14         | VarType IDENTIFIER LPARENTHESES ParamList RPARENTHESES FuncBody

   15 FuncBody: LBRACE Stmts RBRACE

   16 VarDecl: STATIC VarType VarList SEMICOLON
   17        | VarType VarList SEMICOLON
   18        | VarType LPARENTHESES ASTERISK IDENTIFIER RPARENTHESES LPARENTHESES ParamList RPARENTHESES SEMICOLON

   19 TypeDecl: _VarType SEMICOLON

   20 VarType: _VarType
   21        | CONST _VarType

   22 _VarType: BuiltinType
   23         | STRUCT IDENTIFIER LBRACE FieldDecls RBRACE
   24         | STRUCT IDENTIFIER
   25         | UNION IDENTIFIER LBRACE FieldDecls RBRACE
   26         | UNION IDENTIFIER
   27         | ENUM IDENTIFIER LBRACE EnumList RBRACE
   28         | ENUM IDENTIFIER
   29         | _VarType ASTERISK
   30         | IDENTIFIER

   31 VarList: VarList COMMA VarInit
   32        | VarInit
   33        | ε

   34 VarInit: IDENTIFIER ArrayBoundList
   35        | IDENTIFIER ArrayBoundList ASSIGN Expr
   36        | IDENTIFIER ArrayBoundList ASSIGN LBRACE InitList RBRACE
   37        | IDENTIFIER ArrayBoundList ASSIGN LBRACE RBRACE

   38 InitList: InitList COMMA InitItem
   39         | InitItem

   40 InitItem: Expr
   41         | LBRACE InitList RBRACE

   42 ArrayBoundList: ArrayBoundList ArrayBound
   43               | ArrayBound
   44               | ε

   45 ArrayBound: LBRACKET INTEGER RBRACKET
   46           | LBRACKET RBRACKET

   47 ParamList: ParamList COMMA Param
   48          | ParamList COMMA ELLIPSES
   49          | Param
   50          | ELLIPSES
   51          | ε

   52 Param: VarType IDENTIFIER
   53      | VarType
   54      | VarType LPARENTHESES ASTERISK IDENTIFIER RPARENTHESES LPARENTHESES ParamList RPARENTHESES

   55 BuiltinType: CHAR
   56            | SHORT
   57            | INT
   58            | LONG
   59            | UNSIGNED
   60            | UNSIGNED CHAR
   61            | UNSIGNED SHORT
   62            | UNSIGNED INT
   63            | UNSIGNED LONG
   64            | FLOAT
   65            | DOUBLE
   66            | BOOL
   67            | VOID

   68 FieldDecls: FieldDecls FieldDecl
   69           | ε

   70 FieldDecl: VarType MemberList SEMICOLON
   71          | SEMICOLON

   72 MemberList: MemberList COMMA IDENTIFIER
   73           | IDENTIFIER
   74           | ε

   75 EnumList: EnumList COMMA Enum
   76         | Enum
   77         | ε

   78 Enum: IDENTIFIER
   79     | IDENTIFIER ASSIGN INTEGER
   80     | IDENTIFIER ASSIGN SUB INTEGER

   81 Stmts: Stmts Stmt
   82      | ε

   83 Stmt: Expr SEMICOLON
   84     | IfStmt
   85     | SwitchStmt
   86     | ForStmt
   87     | DoStmt
   88     | WhileStmt
   89     | ContinueStmt
   90     | BreakStmt
   91     | ReturnStmt
   92     | Block
   93     | TypeDecl
   94     | TypedefDecl
   95     | VarDecl
   96     | SEMICOLON

   97 IfStmt: IF LPARENTHESES Expr RPARENTHESES Stmt ELSE Stmt
   98       | IF LPARENTHESES Expr RPARENTHESES Stmt

   99 SwitchStmt: SWITCH LPARENTHESES Expr RPARENTHESES LBRACE CaseStmtList RBRACE

  100 CaseStmtList: CaseStmtList CaseStmt
  101             | ε

  102 CaseStmt: CASE Expr COLON Stmts
  103         | DEFAULT COLON Stmts

  104 ForStmt: FOR LPARENTHESES Expr SEMICOLON Expr SEMICOLON Expr RPARENTHESES Stmt
  105        | FOR LPARENTHESES SEMICOLON Expr SEMICOLON Expr RPARENTHESES Stmt
  106        | FOR LPARENTHESES VarDecl Expr SEMICOLON Expr RPARENTHESES Stmt

  107 DoStmt: DO Stmt WHILE LPARENTHESES Expr RPARENTHESES SEMICOLON

  108 WhileStmt: WHILE LPARENTHESES Expr RPARENTHESES Stmt

  109 ContinueStmt: CONTINUE SEMICOLON

  110 BreakStmt: BREAK SEMICOLON

  111 ReturnStmt: RETURN SEMICOLON
  112           | RETURN Expr SEMICOLON

  113 Block: LBRACE Stmts RBRACE

  114 Expr: IDENTIFIER
  115     | Constant
  116     | LPARENTHESES Expr RPARENTHESES
  117     | Expr COMMA Expr
  118     | IDENTIFIER LPARENTHESES ExprList RPARENTHESES
  119     | Expr DOT IDENTIFIER
  120     | Expr ARROW IDENTIFIER
  121     | Expr LBRACKET Expr RBRACKET
  122     | LPARENTHESES VarType RPARENTHESES Expr
  123     | LPARENTHESES IDENTIFIER RPARENTHESES
  124     | LPARENTHESES IDENTIFIER RPARENTHESES Expr
  125     | SIZEOF LPARENTHESES VarType RPARENTHESES
  126     | SIZEOF LPARENTHESES Expr RPARENTHESES
  127     | SIZEOF LPARENTHESES IDENTIFIER RPARENTHESES
  128     | ADD Expr
  129     | SUB Expr
  130     | ASTERISK Expr
  131     | AMPERSAND Expr
